      "created_at": "2017-03-16T18:05:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Why would they just casually glance over Omnitron X getting destroyed in the Tactics timeline without explaining how that ever happened? You'd think that would be a really big deal for the heros and especially Unity after, you know, the whole Omnitron-U storyline, so why was this just ignored? Little bits like this kinda get lost in the fold</p>",
