    {
      "id": 192135,
      "name": "Foote",
      "username": "Foote",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-03-17T13:03:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Bigbywolfe\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/dbc845/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Bigbywolfe:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Foote wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Why would they just casually glance over Omnitron X getting destroyed in the Tactics timeline without explaining how that ever happened? You'd think that would be a really big deal for the heros and especially Unity after, you know, the whole Omnitron-U storyline, so why was this just ignored? Little bits like this kinda get lost in the fold\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;\n<p>Omnitron-X was already destroyed prior to Obliveaon so it was Omnitron-U that was lost I believe.<br>It didn't feel ignored to me at all.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You're missing some bits. Omnitron X was destroyed but merged with unitys OmniBot prior to Obliveaon. In Oblivaeon its stated that the body of OmniBot was deteriorating and badly damaged, so&nbsp;it took some time to build itself back up again. Thats when the worlds split into Tactics and RPG timelines. There is a point between him fighting with Oblivaeon and when reminants of&nbsp;Omnitron IV find the destroyed head of OmnitronX (as seen in the Tactics comic) to assimilate and become Omnitron V where Omnitron is destroyed again, and I wanna know what it is.</p>",
