      "raw": "[quote=\"Bigbywolfe\"]\n\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>Foote wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">Why would they just casually glance over Omnitron X getting destroyed in the Tactics timeline without explaining how that ever happened? You&#39;d think that would be a really big deal for the heros and especially Unity after, you know, the whole Omnitron-U storyline, so why was this just ignored? Little bits like this kinda get lost in the fold\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;\n\nOmnitron-X was already destroyed prior to Obliveaon so it was Omnitron-U that was lost I believe.<br />It didn&#39;t feel ignored to me at all.\n\n[/quote]\n\nYou&#39;re missing some bits. Omnitron X was destroyed but merged with unitys OmniBot prior to Obliveaon. In Oblivaeon its stated that the body of OmniBot was deteriorating and badly damaged, so&nbsp;it took some time to build itself back up again. Thats when the worlds split into Tactics and RPG timelines. There is a point between him fighting with Oblivaeon and when reminants of&nbsp;Omnitron IV find the destroyed head of OmnitronX (as seen in the Tactics comic) to assimilate and become Omnitron V where Omnitron is destroyed again, and I wanna know what it is.\n",
