      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-03-17T13:18:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It would be a good question to ask though I'm wondering when they will do their Interludes to answer follow up questions. &nbsp; &nbsp;What I would guess is in the RPG timeline he wasn't involved in an OblivAeon fight that lead to his ultimate demise in Tactics. &nbsp; I would also guess that OblivAeon fight either involved him trying to save Unity again and/or trying to harness what was left of Omnitron IV to fight against OblivAeon. &nbsp;</p>",
