      "created_at": "2017-03-18T21:09:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think the timeline split is the key. &nbsp;Whatever happened that caused the world to get more damaged by Oblivaeon in the Tactics timeline is probably what killed Omnitron X. &nbsp;I wouldn't be surprised if they glossed over it in the podcast because they are waiting to discuss that topic until they reveal more info on the RPG.</p>",
